EN:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Today's the{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}} Autumn Moon {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}festival,{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
and we celebrate it by admiring
the moon!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}The moon isn't actually out yet,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
but hold tight, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}La luna stasera è proprio bella!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Secondo me,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} oggi è in grado
di far avverare i desideri.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Prova a esprimerne uno!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}The moon is so beautiful tonight,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I kind of feel like it's smiling down
on all of us!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ay buradan bu kadar havalı görünüyorsa,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
yakından nasıl görünüyordur bir düşün!
Keşke bugün astronot olsaydım!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Acayip güzel olurdu!
